# welcome-tab-cta (h10-page): Tab twice: the gear's focus ring, then the
# link's (the UA focus ring on an anchor, measured on ref-h10; ref-WebKit's
# Tab skips the link, the known quirk, category e).
route welcome
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
tab
tab
shot welcome-tab-cta
